   "kind": "note",
   "props": {
    "text": "22:10  Dr. Voss in. Says don't wait up. Nineteenth night running.\n23:40  Solace (signals) in, carrying the director's kid again. Fourteen months old and he's got more clearance than I do.\n01:05  Radio on the desk keeps opening the squelch by itself. Logged it. Hale says ignore it.\n02:31  Hale just went down at a run. Didn't sign.\n02:40  Somebody is on channel two and it is my voice. I am not on channel two.",
