  {
   "symbol": "n",
   "kind": "note",
   "props": {
    "text": "TO: All posts\nFROM: Hale\n\nThree rules. They are not suggestions.\n\n1. Nothing below sublevel two is opened without the Director AND me, in person, in the same room.\n2. If you hear a colleague on the radio and cannot see that colleague, you do not act on what you hear. You come and find me.\n3. Nobody uses a receiver alone. Ever. It knows when you are alone.\n\nI don't care how it sounds. I care that you go home.\n— M.H.",
    "title": "Memo — M. Hale, Chief of Security"
   },
   "sequence": -1,
   "lines": -1
  },
  {
   "symbol": "o",
   "kind": "use",
