  {
   "symbol": "t",
   "kind": "note",
   "props": {
    "text": "NORTHLINE RECOVERY — FIELD WORK ORDER\n\nSite: HELIX-9 (decommissioned 1998). Mountain District 4.\nTechnician: D. ARLEN, emergency communications.\n\nTasks:\n 1. Restore auxiliary power.\n 2. Repair the emergency uplink in the Communications Centre.\n 3. Locate and recover any research records.\n 4. Report on the status of the 1998 staff. (41 persons. No remains were ever logged.)\n 5. Re-establish contact with the surface. Exit.\n\nNote from dispatch: the site beacon woke up three weeks ago and requested a communications engineer.\nIt requested you by name.\nWe assume a database fault. Good luck.",
    "title": "Work Order NR-2026-1017"
   },
   "sequence": -1,
