     ],
     "vo": "marcus_fa687e369e"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "MARCUS (TAPE)",
      "Voss calls it 'the correspondent'. Like it's a pen pal. The signals team call it the Listener, and I think they've got the better of it."
     ],
     "vo": "marcus_f579af969b"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "MARCUS (TAPE)",
      "It doesn't talk. It repeats. It takes whatever you give it and hands it back in your own mouth."
     ],
     "vo": "marcus_600aa995a4"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "MARCUS (TAPE)",
      "Last night it asked the night shift for somebody. By name. A name that isn't on my roster."
     ],
     "vo": "marcus_8039b710f4"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
